Dadhimukha falls at Sugrīva feet and begs assurance --- Dadhimukha reports monkeys ate Madhuvana and drank honey --- Guards protesting are beaten with hands knees and driven out --- Lakṣmaṇa asks Sugrīva why forest guard comes sorrowful --- Sugrīva tells Lakṣmaṇa Aṅgada-led heroes ate the grove --- Sugrīva declares Sītā seen and Hanumān the sole cause --- Sugrīva praises Hanumān wisdom resolve vigor and learning --- Sugrīva cites Jāmbavān Aṅgada Hanumān leadership as sure success --- Sugrīva forgives deed and longs to see band with Rāghavas
